ed text hierarchy in the actual render.","fix":"Limit to two text beats max: hook and final CTA, with clean safe placement and better timing against action peaks."},{"severity":"MEDIUM","category":"brand","timestamp_seconds":12.2,"problem":"Brand identity is only established late; the Reel relies heavily on food action before viewers know whose experience this is.","fix":"Introduce a subtle brand cue earlier, either through text or a more premium chef/plate moment that feels clearly KAIRO-coded."},{"severity":"MEDIUM","category":"cta","timestamp_seconds":12.5,"problem":"The CTA is understandable, but it lands a little late and competes with the bite close rather than being integrated as a decisive end-card moment.","fix":"Make the last 1.5-2s a cleaner brand/location CTA over the bite reaction or a tighter premium hero frame."}]
